      "text": "bone of my bones, and flesh of my flesh, Gen. 2:23 (Moses 3:23; Abr. 5:17). all flesh had corrupted his way upon the earth, Gen. 6:12. shall eat the flesh in that night, Ex. 12:8. life of all flesh is the blood, Lev. 17:14. not make any cuttings in your flesh for the dead, Lev. 19:28 (21:5). eat the flesh of your sons … of your daughters, Lev. 26:29 (Deut. 28:53; Jer. 19:9). God of the spirits of all flesh, Num. 16:22. With him is an arm of flesh, 2 Chr. 32:8. in my flesh shall I see God, Job 19:26. my flesh also shall rest in hope, Ps. 16:9 (Acts 2:26). My flesh and my heart faileth, Ps. 73:26. Who giveth food to all flesh, Ps. 136:25. eat every man the flesh of his own arm, Isa. 9:20. All flesh is grass, Isa. 40:6 (1 Pet. 1:24). Cursed be the man that … maketh flesh his arm, Jer. 17:5. will give them an heart of flesh, Ezek. 11:19 (36:26).",
